<devicesets>
<deviceset name="WE-SLSP" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:54102994/1" prefix="L">
<description>WE-SLSP Common Mode Choke Line Slim Profile

Characteristics
High current up to 6 A
Low profile in SMT construction, only 2.5 mm height
Compact Case
Low leackage inductance
Rated voltage up to 100 V
AEC-Q200 qualified

Applications
Data lines
PoE (Power over Ethernet)
USB
PLC 24 V to 48 V bus systems
Micro inverters

Details see: www.we-online.com/components/products/WE-SLSP

Created by Ella 2026-10-13
2026 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
